cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software for academic research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "pi-literature-review"
abstract: "An open and login-free literature review extension for the Pi coding agent.
  It provides deterministic multi-source search across arXiv, Crossref,
  OpenAlex, and Semantic Scholar, with HTTP-verified identifiers, legal
  open-access PDF selection, and grounded synthesis over local PDFs with
  page-exact citations. No language model is involved in bibliographic search,
  identifier verification, or citation path. The system is designed to
  run with local language models and embedding models, including on
  low-performance hardware, enabling a fully local literature review workflow
  without requiring cloud-based AI services."
authors:
